WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Hi and welcome to the team.
I'm your program manager, Christie,

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.000
and I'm here to support and guide you
throughout your externship.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
You can think of me as a mentor,
a manager, and a facilitator.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
I'm here to help you navigate the experience,
connect with experts, and make the most of your time.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Here's more about what you can expect
from me throughout the externship.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
I'll provide guidance on how to work on your projects
and how to stay on track.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.500
I will also facilitate your interactions
with our host company

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.000
and with industry professionals
through live meetings.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
I'll ensure that you have a smooth
and productive externship experience.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Most importantly, I'll make sure you feel supported as you
prepare to gain real work experience and practical skills.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.000
I can't wait to start on this journey
with you on the team.
